{"type":"message","id":"f6b6b631","parentId":"97c1b0a6","timestamp":"2026-02-16T16:01:15.012Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No OpenClaw found in standard locations. At this point, I need to make an assessment. The task is to investigate gateway disconnections, but there's no evidence that OpenClaw is installed. I have a few options:\n\n1. Assume OpenClaw is not installed and provide a report stating that, with recommendations for installation and configuration\n2. Try to install OpenClaw (but that's beyond the scope of \"investigate\" - that would be \"install and configure\")\n3. Look for alternative evidence like Docker containers, etc.\n\nI think the most appropriate is to document that the OpenClaw gateway is not found on the system, and therefore cannot investigate disconnections. However, I should provide a comprehensive guide on how to set up OpenClaw with proper service configuration, monitoring, and resilience features to prevent future disconnections.\n\nBut let me not jump to conclusions yet. Let me check if there's any environment variable or path that might indicate OpenClaw.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c591f5d383ef403ba2193fc3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"echo %OPENCLAW_HOME% && echo %PATH% | tr : \\\\n | findstr /i openclaw"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":14690,"output":496,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15186,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771257671195}}
