{"type":"message","id":"457ff26d","parentId":"4ae1735b","timestamp":"2026-02-16T16:01:24.079Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Okay, so OpenClaw is not installed or not in the PATH. Given the task, I need to provide a stability audit report. Since I cannot find the gateway, I should:\n\n1. State that OpenClaw gateway is not currently installed or detected on the system\n2. Provide a comprehensive guide for proper installation and configuration to prevent disconnections\n3. Include steps for setting up as a Windows service with auto-restart\n4. Include monitoring and logging recommendations\n5. Include plugin stability considerations\n\nBut the task specifically mentions \"frequent OpenClaw gateway disconnections\" and \"having to manually restart the service repeatedly\". This suggests the user knows it's installed and is experiencing issues. Maybe the installation is in a different user account or location.\n\nLet me check if there's any reference to OpenClaw in the registry, particularly in services.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5f186a142d374afa86fdc64b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"Get-ItemProperty HKLM:\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\* | Where-Object {$_.DisplayName -like \"*openclaw*\" -or $_.Name -like \"*openclaw*\"} | Select-Object Name, DisplayName, StartType, State | Format-Table -AutoSize"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":14956,"output":489,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15445,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771257675089}}
